%N A399968 Decimal expansion of 3*Pi^2/64.
%C A399968 Moments of products of 2 Bessel functions: Integral_{x=0..oo} x^j K_0(x)*K_1(x) dx = 2^(j-4)*j/(j-1)!*Gamma(j/2)^4, at j=3. [Gradshteyn-Ryzhik 6.576.4]
%H A399968 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A399968/b399968.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..10000</a>
%H A399968 R. J. Mathar, <a href="https://vixra.org/abs/1606.0141">Some definite integrals over a power multiplied by four modified Bessel Functions</a>, vixra:1606.0141 (2016), Defn. 2.
%F A399968 Equals integral_{x=0..infinity} x^3*K_0(x)*K_1(x) dx where K_n are Bessel (Macdonald) functions.
%F A399968 Equals (3/2)*A244854.
%F A399968 Equals A268508^2 = A399485/2. - _Hugo Pfoertner_, Sep 17 2026
